      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The punchline: No single mode wins everything.\nKeyword wins for specific lookups. Semantic wins conceptual. Hybrid is the general-purpose answer.",
